(site-atmos)
*title Site atmosphere
*atmos site
  alt pres rho
  0 2115.0 0.00223
  10000 1485.0 0.00166
  20000 830.0 0.00105
  30000 627.0 0.00089
  40000 241.0 0.00058
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 probe start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=20000 long=0 lat=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file atmosphere.dat time alt temp pres rho sndspd nu
  *segment 1 sample
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.1
    *when time=1 stop
*end
